# Project Conventions

- **Two codebases:** `software/` (TypeScript/pnpm) and `firmware/` (C++/PlatformIO) — no shared source
- Software monorepo: `software/apps/web`, `software/apps/api`, `software/packages/shared`
- Integration boundary: REST API + ISO 8601 timestamps (see `docs/knowledge/`)
- Use Temporal API for all date/time logic in software — never `Date` for business logic
- Store timestamps as UTC ISO 8601 strings in DB and API
- All events scoped by `dogId`
- Poop implies taken out: Out = hadPoop false, Poop = hadPoop true
